WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.230
Asked which commandment
matters most, Jesus names two:

2
00:00:04.280 --> 00:00:07.830
love God, and love your
neighbour as yourself.

3
00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:09.500
Paul goes further.

4
00:00:09.550 --> 00:00:15.550
Faith, hope and love remain, he writes,
and the greatest of these is love.

5
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:21.450
For Christians, forgiveness, honesty and
conscience all grow from this one root.

6
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:23.630
But where does that love come from?

7
00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:26.690
And what does it ask of
those who live by it?

8
00:00:26.740 --> 00:00:31.130
In this mission, you'll read one of the
New Testament's great passages on love,

9
00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:33.140
and ask what it claims.

10
00:00:33.190 --> 00:00:37.770
Then you'll ask what difference this
love makes to the way Christians act.

11
00:00:37.820 --> 00:00:42.320
Your mission: find out where Christians
believe this love comes from,

12
00:00:42.370 --> 00:00:43.890
and what it asks of them.
